%% pmcluster backup — one run, end to end.
%% Colours: green = in code and tested | red = NOT in code yet |
%% amber = host/ops change (no code) | purple = data.
%%
%% System packages: NONE are missing on nxt-sw-1-m / nxt-sw-3-w.
%% Verified: fsfreeze+flock (util-linux), lvcreate/lvs/lvremove (lvm2 2.03.31),
%% mount/umount, tar, gzip — all installed. sqlite3, psql and pg_controldata are
%% NOT installed and are NOT needed: SQLite verification links into the binary
%% (modernc.org/sqlite) and Postgres is only presence-checked.

sequenceDiagram
 autonumber

 box rgb(6,78,59) IN CODE — shipped and tested
 participant T as systemd timer
 participant A as backup-agent (root oneshot)
 participant D as pmcluster daemon (this node)
 participant L as pmcluster daemon (leader)
 participant S as SeaweedFS store (WebDAV)
 end

 box rgb(120,53,15) HOST / OPS — no code
 participant K as kernel + LVM (fsfreeze, lvcreate)
 participant O as operator
 end

 box rgb(76,29,149) DATA
 participant V as volume root (thin LV)
 participant X as archive dir
 participant E as database engines
 end

 box rgb(136,19,55) NOT IN CODE YET
 participant API as plan + run-report API
 end

 T->>A: OnCalendar hourly, Persistent=true
 A->>A: flock -n /run/pmcluster-backup.lock
 Note right of A: one run per node, extra triggers exit

 A->>X: read cached plan.json
 A-->>API: refresh plan from leader (missing endpoint)
 Note over A,API: NOT BUILT — plan publisher. plan.json is hand-placed, and a stale one is harmless.

 A->>K: fsfreeze -f /var/stack/data
 Note over K,V: all writes block, ~ms
 A->>K: lvcreate -s vg0/data
 A->>K: fsfreeze -u
 Note right of A: freeze fails ⇒ NO tar. No live-tree fallback.
 A->>K: mount -o ro the snapshot

 loop one artifact per stack, serial
 A->>V: walk stack/ in the frozen image
 A->>X: tar → backup-node-ts-stack-stack.tar.gz
 A->>X: manifest.json (sha256, snapshot facts)
 A->>E: verify: sqlite integrity_check
 Note right of E: postgres presence only, not validated
 A->>S: PUT artifact (net/http)
 end

 A->>K: umount + lvremove
 Note right of K: pool ≥80% aborts loudly

 A->>X: write run-ts.json
 Note right of A: written before any report
 A--)API: POST /internal/backup/runs (missing endpoint)

 D->>X: discover *.tar.gz → backups rows
 Note over D,X: no report needed — the archive is the record
 O->>D: backup list / browse / restore
 O->>A: backup-agent drill archive
 A->>A: extract + integrity_check (proves restorability)

 alt leader is down during the run
 Note over A,L: a systemd job, not a leader client: it finishes
 D->>X: rows still discovered on the next pass
 L->>D: plan refresh waits for promotion
 end

 rect rgb(120,53,15)
 Note over K,V: NOT CODE — thin pool, then PMCLUSTER_BACKUP_AGENT=1, an hour + a drill, then retire offen (leader last)
 end
